WEBVTT

00:01.760 --> 00:04.070
These guys are tough!

00:04.070 --> 00:05.990
They might be strong...

00:05.990 --> 00:06.990
but...

00:07.530 --> 00:09.150
we're stronger!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.750
Taste the might of Rose's personal unit!

00:30.720 --> 00:33.970
That sword is likely imbued with a curse.

00:33.970 --> 00:36.140
I can't afford to be hit by that.

00:47.070 --> 00:48.070
Nero-sama!

00:55.370 --> 00:56.370
Is that all?

00:57.950 --> 01:00.790
I know that didn't do much.

01:00.790 --> 01:02.380
Get up.

01:25.520 --> 01:30.190
THE WRONG WAY TO USE HEALING MAGIC

02:41.020 --> 02:45.020
#9 THE END AND THE BEGINNING

02:45.020 --> 02:46.250
Goodness.

02:46.900 --> 02:49.860
Who would have thought that
a mere monster-hunting mission

02:49.860 --> 02:52.280
would give us this much trouble.

02:52.280 --> 02:56.200
Look at what's become
of the men I trained.

02:58.570 --> 02:59.740
Rose.

02:59.740 --> 03:02.620
Your men seem plenty skilled as well.

03:02.980 --> 03:04.620
Where'd this come from?

03:04.620 --> 03:06.500
I'm offering them my praise.

03:06.500 --> 03:11.420
You guys are the toughest
opponents I've ever faced.

03:11.420 --> 03:13.130
Why, thank you.

03:13.590 --> 03:16.300
You humans have no more Heroes.

03:16.300 --> 03:17.470
Come again?

03:17.470 --> 03:21.390
There are no longer any humans
who wield exceptional power.

03:21.390 --> 03:22.810
That's what I believed.

03:22.810 --> 03:24.100
So what?

03:24.100 --> 03:27.770
Did you guys think you could beat us
now that we no longer have Heroes?

03:27.770 --> 03:29.400
Is that it?

03:29.980 --> 03:33.070
If so, you take us too lightly.

03:33.070 --> 03:34.190
Indeed I have.

03:34.190 --> 03:36.400
But my mind has been changed.

03:36.400 --> 03:41.620
You lot have become the greatest obstacle
in the way of achieving our ultimate goal.

03:41.620 --> 03:43.330
Ultimate goal?

03:43.330 --> 03:46.580
The era of demonkind
living in fear of humans is at an end.

03:46.580 --> 03:48.670
Our king will rise again.

03:49.500 --> 03:51.790
He is cruel, savage, and heartless.

03:51.790 --> 03:54.380
But to us, he is merciful
and benevolent.

03:54.380 --> 03:57.930
He is an absolute being
who promised us victory!

03:57.930 --> 03:59.090
Wha?!

03:59.090 --> 04:00.260
That is why!

04:00.260 --> 04:02.430
For him to bring us victory!

04:02.430 --> 04:05.050
For the prosperity of all demonkind!

04:05.050 --> 04:08.390
We have to kill you here and now!

04:08.390 --> 04:11.020
Even at the cost of our own lives!

04:11.020 --> 04:12.020
All right!

04:15.820 --> 04:17.700
L-Let me go!

04:18.240 --> 04:19.410
This guy...

04:19.410 --> 04:21.320
How does he still have the strength?!

04:22.490 --> 04:25.200
We are the Demon Lord's swords.

04:25.200 --> 04:27.160
Even if our bodies are broken...

04:27.160 --> 04:30.080
We will drag our enemies down with us!

04:30.080 --> 04:31.670
Stop it!

04:33.670 --> 04:35.550
Glory to...

04:35.550 --> 04:37.170
the Demon Lord!

04:40.590 --> 04:42.010
Naruka!

04:50.480 --> 04:52.100
You bastard!

04:52.500 --> 04:54.150
B-But how?!

04:54.150 --> 04:55.570
I knocked him out!

04:59.070 --> 05:01.200
What's with these guys?

05:01.200 --> 05:03.820
Don't they care about their own lives?

05:03.820 --> 05:05.080
Damn it!

05:05.490 --> 05:07.100
Everyone! Calm down!

05:08.160 --> 05:10.080
Stop it! Release me!

05:19.170 --> 05:21.470
This is bad! I won't make it in time!

05:21.470 --> 05:24.910
To you, I must be a real demon.

05:25.680 --> 05:27.560
I am compelling my men to kill themselves

05:27.560 --> 05:31.310
and defiling the sanctity of our battle.

05:31.730 --> 05:33.150
On top of that,

05:33.150 --> 05:34.560
Out of the way!

05:34.560 --> 05:39.030
I am distracting you
by putting your men in peril.

05:46.030 --> 05:49.200
I can see your clumsy moves coming...

05:49.200 --> 05:50.370
from a mile away!

05:50.790 --> 05:52.160
This is just a scratch!

05:54.290 --> 05:58.460
My crimson sword can dispel all magic.

05:58.460 --> 06:01.420
It inflicts a temporary curse
on anything it cuts.

06:01.420 --> 06:05.470
Healing magic won't work on that wound.

06:06.390 --> 06:07.810
Captain!

06:07.810 --> 06:09.720
Healing magic! Now!

06:19.610 --> 06:23.490
You still want to fight
with your impaired vision?

06:24.030 --> 06:27.480
There is no way you will be
able to fight to your fullest.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.370
I'm going to put an end to this.

06:32.290 --> 06:34.870
Damn it. My depth perception.

06:43.420 --> 06:44.970
O... wl.

06:47.210 --> 06:49.310
Cap... tain.

07:10.280 --> 07:12.870
If you're fighting alongside us,

07:12.870 --> 07:14.960
we'll be invincible!

07:15.310 --> 07:16.370
If anything happens,

07:16.370 --> 07:18.500
you can just heal us
with your magic!

07:18.500 --> 07:19.380
Yeah!

07:19.380 --> 07:21.060
No need to worry about getting hurt!

07:21.060 --> 07:22.510
We can go all out!

07:23.300 --> 07:26.170
They all believed in me.

07:27.090 --> 07:29.390
Believed that I would save them.

07:29.390 --> 07:32.430
Believed that they'd be safe with me.

07:34.600 --> 07:38.560
Owl, why didn't you run?

07:38.560 --> 07:41.270
You wouldn't have been cut down.

07:42.270 --> 07:44.690
It's all because I was weak.

07:45.030 --> 07:48.110
I put too much faith in my own abilities.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.990
The deaths of my men...

07:52.030 --> 07:54.700
the deaths of your men...

07:54.700 --> 07:56.120
I will never forget them.

07:58.870 --> 08:00.580
Die here...

08:01.290 --> 08:02.510
Rose.

08:07.170 --> 08:08.970
Don't screw with me!

08:11.930 --> 08:14.600
You'll never forget them?

08:16.980 --> 08:19.230
Take this!

08:19.230 --> 08:21.190
What do you know about them?

08:21.190 --> 08:22.610
Huh?

08:22.610 --> 08:24.530
What do you know?

08:24.530 --> 08:25.850
You piece of shit...

08:25.850 --> 08:26.860
who sacrifices...

08:26.860 --> 08:28.570
his own men...

08:28.570 --> 08:30.570
in a suicide attack?!

08:32.659 --> 08:34.950
There's nothing more insulting...

08:35.830 --> 08:38.789
than having someone like you
empathize with us!

08:42.130 --> 08:45.590
Nothing!

08:59.600 --> 09:00.600
I'll kill you.

09:01.690 --> 09:03.610
I swear I'll kill you!

09:06.400 --> 09:10.280
Damn it. I'm so close...

09:10.280 --> 09:13.490
I... will kill him!

09:14.740 --> 09:16.620
M-Master!

09:17.620 --> 09:19.830
I'll get you down right now!

09:19.830 --> 09:24.080
Amila, didn't I tell you to stay back?

09:24.790 --> 09:26.800
I'm sorry, Master!

09:26.800 --> 09:29.170
But, I just couldn't leave you!

09:29.170 --> 09:30.590
What's this?

09:30.590 --> 09:32.180
What is this?!

09:32.760 --> 09:35.260
He sacrificed his men...

09:35.680 --> 09:39.520
but he is being saved
by one of them like I was?

09:41.820 --> 09:42.600
Stop right there!

09:59.700 --> 10:01.080
What is this?

10:02.540 --> 10:05.580
What the hell is this?!

10:08.130 --> 10:09.960
Captain...

10:09.960 --> 10:10.970
Owl!

10:17.560 --> 10:18.890
Captain...

10:18.890 --> 10:20.180
Don't speak!

10:20.180 --> 10:21.480
I'm coming to heal you!

10:21.980 --> 10:23.480
It's not going to work.

10:23.480 --> 10:26.480
He got me pretty good.

10:27.310 --> 10:31.740
...and this wound can't be healed, can it?

10:32.780 --> 10:35.110
We won't know until we try!

10:37.370 --> 10:39.580
It's... okay.

10:40.080 --> 10:41.660
I don't...

10:41.660 --> 10:43.290
regret what I did.

10:43.960 --> 10:46.290
It was an honor...

10:47.170 --> 10:49.000
to have fought for you.

10:49.390 --> 10:50.710
Don't give me that crap!

10:50.710 --> 10:52.720
What are you saying?!

10:52.720 --> 10:55.510
I'm sure everyone thought the same...

10:56.430 --> 10:57.760
So, please...

10:57.760 --> 11:01.470
stay the captain we love and admire...

11:01.470 --> 11:02.600
forever and ever.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.560
I am not going to let you die!

11:05.560 --> 11:07.730
Not on my life!

11:08.360 --> 11:09.770
That's...

11:09.770 --> 11:11.110
my captain.

11:12.150 --> 11:14.650
That's... who you are.

11:40.470 --> 11:42.600
In the near future,

11:42.600 --> 11:44.850
the king of demons will revive

11:44.850 --> 11:48.770
and attempt to invade our kingdom.

11:49.190 --> 11:53.400
The man I fought, Nero,
claimed as such.

11:54.360 --> 11:58.780
Their monster hunting probably
has something to do with it.

12:00.160 --> 12:01.330
Duly noted.

12:01.780 --> 12:04.660
That ends my report.

12:06.160 --> 12:07.160
If I may...

12:10.080 --> 12:12.340
I have a request for you, Lloyd-sama.

12:13.170 --> 12:14.170
Anything.

12:14.960 --> 12:17.380
I would like to be
relieved of all my duties

12:17.380 --> 12:20.430
as battalion commander and a knight.

12:22.510 --> 12:25.980
Is that what you really want, Rose?

12:26.430 --> 12:27.430
It is.

12:27.430 --> 12:31.360
I don't deserve to be a knight any longer.

12:31.360 --> 12:32.820
I will take my leave.

12:44.240 --> 12:48.000
Excuse me, are you Captain Rose?

12:49.160 --> 12:52.080
I am, and you two are?

12:52.840 --> 12:56.710
My good-for-nothing son
was under your care.

12:57.130 --> 12:59.680
Oh, his name was Josh.

13:03.100 --> 13:04.720
I see...

13:04.720 --> 13:06.180
I am very sorry.

13:07.520 --> 13:08.810
He died...

13:09.600 --> 13:10.980
because of me.

13:12.520 --> 13:14.690
Thank you very much.

13:15.550 --> 13:17.770
Thank you for bringing him back to us...

13:18.490 --> 13:21.610
so that we could see him again.

13:21.610 --> 13:24.910
He had a satisfied look on his face.

13:24.910 --> 13:26.790
He was quite the delinquent,

13:27.110 --> 13:30.710
but he started to brighten up
after he joined your squad.

13:30.710 --> 13:32.620
We are in your debt.

13:56.610 --> 13:57.180
ONE MONTH LATER

13:57.180 --> 14:00.240
The king himself
paid you a visit, didn't he?

14:00.690 --> 14:03.990
Yeah, he did.
Gave me quite a shock.

14:03.990 --> 14:08.740
I still can't believe he came
all this way. By himself.

14:09.410 --> 14:12.870
It's because you've been
keeping to yourself for a month!

14:12.870 --> 14:15.170
Did he try to convince you
to come back to duty?

14:15.490 --> 14:16.290
Nope.

14:16.290 --> 14:19.670
Lloyd-sama came here
for the same reason as you.

14:19.670 --> 14:23.590
To make sure I didn't try
to join those guys.

14:23.590 --> 14:24.590
Got it?

14:26.350 --> 14:27.760
Tell you the truth...

14:27.760 --> 14:29.520
dying might not be so bad after all.

14:31.930 --> 14:33.020
Cut it out!

14:33.980 --> 14:37.060
No need to get your panties in a bunch.

14:37.060 --> 14:40.480
It just crossed my mind.
That's all.

14:43.030 --> 14:44.150
If you say so.

14:46.620 --> 14:50.790
The injuries caused
by that sword seem to be healing.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.870
Yeah.

14:51.870 --> 14:54.540
Evidently, the curse is only temporary.

14:54.540 --> 14:55.960
Then why...

14:55.960 --> 14:57.870
haven't you tried healing your right eye?

15:06.590 --> 15:07.970
This injury...

15:08.450 --> 15:12.180
is the proof of sin
that I led them to their deaths.

15:13.020 --> 15:15.890
It's so that I don't forget their deaths.

15:17.150 --> 15:18.690
I don't plan to take my own life.

15:19.360 --> 15:21.480
It's the life Owl saved, after all...

15:22.070 --> 15:23.070
But...

15:24.990 --> 15:27.990
What am I going to live for now?

15:28.870 --> 15:30.280
Revenge?

15:30.280 --> 15:32.240
To kill that man?

15:32.620 --> 15:36.290
And to kill as many demons as possible?

15:38.210 --> 15:40.790
That's not it, you idiot!

15:41.710 --> 15:43.920
I need to cool my head.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.960
I'm pathetic.

16:22.340 --> 16:25.510
Was I always this weak?

16:25.510 --> 16:27.770
Was I always this frail?

16:28.840 --> 16:31.390
How would they react...

16:31.390 --> 16:33.260
if they could see me now?

16:33.260 --> 16:35.100
Let's see...

16:35.100 --> 16:37.180
I think I'll laugh at you...

16:37.640 --> 16:39.900
and say that you're
not being yourself at all!

16:41.610 --> 16:42.730
Owl!

16:42.730 --> 16:44.400
Listen up, Captain.

16:44.400 --> 16:46.900
Nothing remains static forever.

16:47.250 --> 16:50.530
Everything changes eventually.

16:50.530 --> 16:53.330
We need to accept change to move forward.

16:54.790 --> 17:00.330
However, nothing will change
the fact that you were our captain.

17:00.330 --> 17:01.380
That is why...

17:02.380 --> 17:06.170
There's no need
to worry yourself sick over it.

17:06.960 --> 17:09.050
You remembered!

17:09.050 --> 17:11.430
You remembered everything
you said to me that day.

17:11.430 --> 17:12.680
Then...

17:12.680 --> 17:16.849
do you remember
the last thing I said to you, too?

17:22.020 --> 17:26.690
Please stay the captain we love
and admire, forever and ever.

17:27.089 --> 17:28.280
That's right!

17:28.280 --> 17:30.110
What are you moping about for,

17:30.110 --> 17:32.280
our ogre of a battalion commander?

17:32.280 --> 17:35.450
It's not like you to be
so unsure of yourself!

17:35.450 --> 17:38.870
You'd punch us if we made
the face you're making!

17:39.290 --> 17:43.580
You'd say, "Get out there!
Time to train the hell outta you!"

17:43.580 --> 17:44.580
I'm sure of it!

17:45.880 --> 17:47.000
No doubt about it!

17:51.680 --> 17:53.050
That's right.

17:53.050 --> 17:56.010
I was too focused on your deaths.

17:56.600 --> 18:00.480
I forgot that you guys were
always charging forward.

18:00.480 --> 18:02.100
That's who you guys were.

18:14.660 --> 18:17.200
This is the last time
I'll show any weakness.

18:17.830 --> 18:20.410
Please, just give me this one moment.

18:21.200 --> 18:23.290
I won't stand still any longer!

18:24.750 --> 18:25.790
Captain!

18:35.890 --> 18:37.640
I'm all right now.

18:39.180 --> 18:42.180
I will be the captain
you loved and admired!

18:46.940 --> 18:48.610
I know what I must do.

18:49.270 --> 18:51.070
It's coming...

18:51.070 --> 18:54.200
War with the demons
is just on the horizon.

18:54.200 --> 18:57.200
Many knights will be dispatched
and killed on the battlefield.

18:58.080 --> 19:00.410
In order to prevent that...

19:00.950 --> 19:03.160
I will create an organization.

19:03.160 --> 19:05.670
One to save lives
and prevent anyone from dying.

19:05.670 --> 19:07.420
I need manpower.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.630
At least five members.

19:10.380 --> 19:13.300
I also need at least two healers.

19:13.300 --> 19:15.800
And one who's just like me.

19:16.220 --> 19:17.590
Not just a healer,

19:17.590 --> 19:21.390
but one who can roam the battlefield
and blow past any obstacle in their way.

19:21.390 --> 19:23.850
An average guy probably won't cut it.

19:23.850 --> 19:26.850
But, if I'm able to find
someone like that...

19:27.850 --> 19:29.980
They might be able to stay alive...

19:29.980 --> 19:32.820
and remain by my side.

19:35.700 --> 19:38.490
I'm glad I found you.

19:39.780 --> 19:42.490
What's with that surprised face?

19:42.490 --> 19:44.500
Well... that's because...

19:44.500 --> 19:46.370
of your surprising comment.

19:46.830 --> 19:51.290
You have no idea
how valuable you are.

19:51.670 --> 19:53.840
Valuable?

19:53.840 --> 19:59.050
I can't replace you with just
any old trained-up healer.

19:59.480 --> 20:03.180
Imagine multiples of me running around.

20:03.520 --> 20:05.350
It'll be the end of the world.

20:05.680 --> 20:08.020
You're not supposed to be able to!

20:08.020 --> 20:12.270
Using healing magic to surpass
your physical limitations.

20:12.270 --> 20:14.860
That's something I came up with.

20:14.860 --> 20:17.490
Only the two of us can do it.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.180
Makes sense...

20:21.370 --> 20:23.370
You, Usato...

20:23.370 --> 20:27.080
You are the healer with all
the qualities I've been looking for.

20:27.750 --> 20:32.580
You've managed to do things
that only I've been able to do.

20:34.550 --> 20:36.260
You'll survive.

20:36.260 --> 20:37.470
I'm sure of it.

20:40.970 --> 20:43.100
What's with the grin?

20:43.100 --> 20:44.720
You're creeping me out!

20:45.310 --> 20:46.600
I couldn't help it!

20:46.600 --> 20:47.930
We're almost there!

22:22.280 --> 22:24.820
The bridge is finally finished!

22:25.280 --> 22:28.290
And Baljinak is all ready to go.

22:28.700 --> 22:30.290
Let the invasion begin, huh?

22:30.630 --> 22:31.260
Indeed.

22:31.830 --> 22:34.370
We were a bit delayed,

22:34.370 --> 22:36.500
but we will succeed...

22:37.710 --> 22:39.420
for my Master.

22:40.710 --> 22:42.050
Finally...

22:42.050 --> 22:43.720
I was getting tired of waiting.

22:44.070 --> 22:47.140
I can head to the front lines
after the battle begins, right?

22:47.510 --> 22:48.890
Of course.

22:48.890 --> 22:50.560
Feel free to go wild.

22:50.970 --> 22:52.810
You don't have to tell me twice.

22:52.810 --> 22:56.400
Though, it's gonna be over all too soon.

22:56.400 --> 22:58.320
They're only human, after all.

22:58.730 --> 23:01.150
I don't doubt your strength,

23:01.150 --> 23:02.690
but don't let your guard down.

23:02.690 --> 23:05.490
There are some troublesome
pests on the human side.

23:06.490 --> 23:08.030
The Kidnappers.

23:08.030 --> 23:12.200
The ones who snatch
the fallen away to safety?

23:12.540 --> 23:17.130
Why must we be wary of those
who only know how to run?

23:17.130 --> 23:18.500
Don't underestimate them.

23:18.500 --> 23:20.050
They are monsters.

23:21.380 --> 23:22.760
If they really are monsters,

23:22.760 --> 23:24.970
I might just end up enjoying myself.

23:25.230 --> 23:27.550
Who cares if they're humans or monsters?

23:27.550 --> 23:30.810
If they can satisfy me,
bring them on.

23:32.180 --> 23:33.980
Show me what it's like...

23:33.980 --> 23:35.770
to be alive!
